  aggregate:
    pattern: "STRONG theory + code (161 unit tests green --locked), WEAK empirical + live.
              The kernel is DESIGN- and CODE-complete but OPERATIONALLY NASCENT: only hardware_ingest
              and omega_validator actually run on real state in the live daemon. Everything else is
              logically verified (unit tests) but operationally unexercised."
    mean_score: "~2.4 / 4 across 12 components"
    precision_of_operation:
      "CORRECTNESS of logic: HIGH (161 deterministic unit tests). OPERATIONAL precision (right behavior
       under real load): VALIDATED only for ingest+Ω; UNKNOWN for the rest until live-wired + loop-calibrated.
       So we can certify 'the code does what the spec says' but NOT yet 'the kernel governs a real workload
       correctly' — that needs the deep wiring + the pending experiment loops above."

